<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 689 0 R/E(Authority and procedures for disseminating intelligence to competent authorities.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

319 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 690 0 R/E( Domestic and international cooperation channels.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

320 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 691 0 R/E(Strong privacy, confidentiality and data-protection safeguards.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

321 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 692 0 R/E(Financial intelligence is highly sensitive. A resolution should address lawful access, purpose limitation, confidentiality, audit trails and safeguards against political misuse. Intelligence sharing should be tied to legitimate criminal-justice or national-security purposes and applicable law.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

