<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 694 0 R/E( Law-enforcement FIUs sit within police or investigative structures.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

327 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 695 0 R/E( Judicial FIUs are connected to prosecutorial or judicial authorities.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

328 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 696 0 R/E( Hybrid models combine functions while trying to preserve safeguards.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

