<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 705 0 R/E(Informal value-transfer systems and remittance networks.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

357 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 706 0 R/E(Abuse of charities or non-profit structures.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

