<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 711 0 R/E(Natural-resource or conflict-economy revenues in some settings.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

363 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 137 0 R/E(Financial institutions may respond to uncertainty by exiting whole categories of customers or regions. While this can reduce perceived risk for a bank, it can push legitimate users into less transparent channels. Delegates should promote risk-based controls rather than blanket exclusion.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

364 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 137 0 R/T(DE-RISKING PROBLEM)/E(DE-RISKING PROBLEM)/Pg 19 0 R/K[20]>>
