409 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 139 0 R/T(International Cooperation: FIU-to-FIU & Criminal Justice)/E(International Cooperation: FIU-to-FIU & Criminal Justice)/Pg 21 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

410 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(Financial flows move faster than legal processes. A suspect may live in one state, hold an account in another, use a company registered in a third and move funds through a fourth.No single FIU can see the entire picture.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

411 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 139 0 R/T(Main cooperation channels include:)/E(Main cooperation channels include:)/Pg 21 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

412 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 717 0 R/E(FIU-to-FIU information exchange through appropriate secure channels.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

413 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 718 0 R/E(Mutual legal assistance for evidence requiring formal legal process.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

414 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 719 0 R/E(Extradition where legal conditions are satisfied.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

415 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 720 0 R/E(Joint investigations or coordinated investigative teams where domestic law permits.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

416 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 721 0 R/E( International organizations and regional networks for capacity-building.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

417 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 139 0 R/T(goAML)/E(goAML)/Pg 21 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

418 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(UNODC\220s goAML system illustrates how technology can support the institutional side of this process. The value of such a system is not simply that it stores suspicious transaction reports. A properly governed digital pipeline can standardize submissions, enable searching and analysis, help identify relationships and support dissemination of financial intelligence to competent authorities. The quality of the outcome still depends on the legal framework, reporting quality, analyst expertise, data protection and institutional independence.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

419 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(This distinction is especially important when considering AI and automated analytics. A system can prioritize patterns for human review, but automated risk scores are not themselves proof of criminality. Financial intelligence systems therefore require safeguards against discrimination, over-collection, unauthorized access and unjustified account restrictions.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

420 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 139 0 R/E(UNODC\220s goAML is designed to support FIUs with secure reporting, case management, analysis and intelligence sharing. It can standardize the collection and handling of STRs and other financial reports and support analytical functions.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

